# A void elf warrior in Ammen Vale (mod-allied-races), after its start was checked: its racials
# at work, and its Rescue the Survivors!.
# (The racials are cast with a plain .cast: `.cast X triggered` skips every effect of the spell.)
#
# Preternatural Calm: spells not pushed back by damage (an aura of type 149, REDUCE_PUSHBACK).
target 0
cmd .list auras
expect auras of type 149
# Spatial Rift: a rift torn ahead, then the character through it.
cmd .cast 98711
expect-not teleported
cmd .cast 98711
expect teleported
# Megelon offers the void elves' You Survived!, never the Draenei's.
go 530 -3961.6 -13931.2 100.7
talk 16475
has quest 959279:
expect-not quest 9279:
# Rescue the Survivors!: Gift of the Naaru (a Draenei racial) lent while it's in the log, a
# survivor healed with it standing up for the clone, the gift taken back once it's done.
cmd .quest add 959283
expect learned 28880
go 530 -4147.6 -13883.1 79.4
target 16483
cmd .cast 28880
target 0
wait 7
has credit 959283 16483
expect removed 28880
